  "detail": "Ubisoft shut down Far Cry 3 PS3/X360 online services (MP, co-op) on 1 Oct 2022 (PSU/PlayStation LifeStyle). Irrelevant here: all 6 earned trophies are the MP/co-op ones, every unearned trophy is single-player."
